---

<section id="about" class="about section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
    
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          I'm a Systems Engineer with a strong frontend focus and over <strong>6 years of experience</strong> 
          specializing in React ecosystems. I have a proven track record in delivering responsive 
          web applications with exceptional user experiences.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          My expertise spans <strong>React, Next.js, and modern JavaScript/TypeScript</strong>, 
          complemented by solid backend skills in <strong>Node.js and Python</strong>. I combine 
          formal engineering education with hands-on expertise in modern web development technologies.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          Currently, I'm working at <strong>Wazuh</strong> as a Software Engineer, contributing to 
          the development of new features for the Wazuh Dashboard, an open-source security platform 
          used by organizations worldwide.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          When I'm not coding, I'm always looking for new technologies to learn and ways to 
          improve my skills. I believe in writing clean, maintainable code and creating products 
          that make a difference.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="about-highlights">
        <div class="highlight-card">
          <span class="highlight-number">6+</span>
          <span class="highlight-label">Years of Experience</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="highlight-card">
          <span class="highlight-number">4</span>
          <span class="highlight-label">Companies Worked</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="highlight-card">
          <span class="highlight-number">C1</span>
          <span class="highlight-label">English Level</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-3xl);
    }
  }
  
  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  
  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  .about-text strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .about-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-highlights {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
  
  .highlight-card {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 140px;
    background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    text-align: center;
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .highlight-card {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
  
  .highlight-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  
  .highlight-number {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .highlight-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
